# Testing

After substantive code changes, run and **read** the output of:

- `pnpm check:fast` (`pnpm check` / `verify:fast`) — apply loop: unit + patch-coverage; **no** stryker
- Quality **B** (`test:e2e:changed:quiet` + `stryker:diff`) at stages 4/7/9 only. Full e2e/`pnpm verify` only when CI needs them (or an explicit full-suite request); finish never runs full verify. Out-of-scope per `docs/roadmap/RULES.md`. Flake proof = CI burn-in; local `--repeat-each=3` only after a local fail-then-pass. Playwright gates every PR in CI

Also available: `pnpm check:integrity` (C1 stage 11), `stryker:diff` (B+CI), `test:lhci`, `bench`.

PBT: `@fast-check/vitest`; `numRuns` ~100 locally; CI may raise via `FC_NUM_RUNS`.

Test authorship: skill `write-tests` (mandates in `openspec/config.yaml`).
